# Upload limits: 50 MiB per CSV; 10 MiB for other files.
# Git has no size-based ignore syntax; new oversized files need explicit rules
# in the nearest applicable .gitignore and a size check before uploading.
# These LFS pointers reference pretrained models larger than the limit.
/9_SpaceAGORA.jl-main_full integration/data/GRAM_surrogate/*.jls

